From: Vaciller <wyc_19533480830@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:17:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: gate boot animation exit on network readiness

    - WindowManagerService.java: wait for a validated network (falling back
      to persist.sys.bootanim.net_timeout) before setting service.bootanim.exit
    - BootAnimation.cpp: loop the boot video when showtime==-1 so it plays
      until the system requests exit instead of stopping once

Change-Id: I8cb3e3435913f77878e63c61a5e3812a9fa44afb
---
 cmds/bootanimation/BootAnimation.cpp          |   4 +-
 .../server/wm/WindowManagerService.java       | 148 +++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 144 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

